## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Lane Default (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Blood Wings, Divine Glaive, Wishing Lantern
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Blood Wings
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft lacks reliable chain CC and you need the fastest early cooldown curve.; Winter Crown over Wishing Lantern when Use when a diver can force you after you steal an engage ultimate.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when your front line is stable and the game is decided by raw spell damage instead of shield safety.
- Total cost: 11140 gold

Default ranked setup that gives Valentina cooldown, burn pressure, late penetration, and enough shield value to hold a stolen ultimate for the real fight.

### Ultimate-Cycle Tempo (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Divine Glaive, Winter Crown
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Temporal Reign
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Glowing Wand over Lightning Truncheon when Use when the enemy has sustain or shield value that must be cut before your stolen ultimate lands.; Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when you are not being hard-dived and need permanent movement plus shield value.; Wishing Lantern over Winter Crown when Use against high-HP front lines when your team already has enough peel for you.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Tempo build for coordinated fights where assists let Valentina recycle I Am You and keep non-ultimate skills moving between skirmishes.

### Safe Scaling Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Clock of Destiny, Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy, Holy Crystal, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Enchanted Talisman, Concentrated Energy
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Weapon Master, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when Purify alone will not cover the enemy's repeated stun or slow chain.; Divine Glaive over Holy Crystal when Use when two or more enemies complete meaningful Magic Defense before Lord fights.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in closing fights where one death after a stolen engage ultimate loses the game outright.
- Total cost: 11930 gold

Safer scaling setup for CC-heavy drafts where Valentina needs defensive stat ramp and Purify timing more than early kill pressure.

